    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>An advanced shredder configuration using serrated flechette sub-projectiles that deploy on impact and embed in tissue before the main pellet mass follows through. The flechettes tear open wounds that are difficult to seal even with medi-gel, and the sheer volume of penetrating fragments makes clean wounds nearly impossible. Originally developed by mercenary groups for anti-personnel operations in close quarters. Designed for shotguns. On a hit, the target takes 1d6 persistent bleed damage.</p><p><strong>Activate</strong> — Install on weapon during a 10-minute field maintenance procedure. Requires a shotgun.</p>"
